Build dashboards like Stripe/Vercel. No exceptions.

SPACING RULES (Copy-Paste These Classes)

// ALWAYS use these exact classes:
className="p-6"              // Card padding
className="space-y-6"        // Vertical spacing
className="gap-6"            // Grid gaps
className="px-8 py-12"       // Page container
className="max-w-7xl mx-auto" // Center content
VISUAL RULES (Copy-Paste These Classes)
tsx

// ALWAYS use these exact classes:
className="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200"
// That's your card. Use it everywhere.

className="bg-gray-50"       // Page background
className="border-b border-gray-200" // Dividers
TYPOGRAPHY RULES

// Page title
<h1 className="text-3xl font-bold">Title</h1>

// Section title  
<h2 className="text-xl font-semibold">Section</h2>

// Card title
<h3 className="text-lg font-medium">Card Title</h3>

// Body text
<p className="text-gray-600">Body text</p>

// Small text
<span className="text-sm text-gray-500">Small text</span>

BUTTON RULES
Make sure any buttons if implemeneted are clickable
// Primary button
<button className="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
  Primary
</button>

// Secondary button  
<button className="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
  Secondary
</button>
FORBIDDEN
❌ p-1, p-2, p-3 (too small)
❌ shadow-2xl (too heavy)
❌ Bright colors for backgrounds
❌ Multiple font sizes without hierarchy
❌ No hover states
❌ Sharp corners (no rounded)

ONE RULE TO RULE THEM ALL
Copy the layout template above. Replace content. Done.